{"schemaVersion":1,"id":403,"sections":[{"id":"922001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20685],"start":0,"count":19},{"id":"922001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20686],"start":19,"count":12}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:1","scriptId":20685,"text":"虽然很清楚钢舞姬的失常绝对和旅行者有关，但我们所经过的路线却没有出现任何旅行者。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:2","scriptId":20685,"text":"“奇怪，都连续搜索过几片区域了，怎么还没找到旅行者的基地……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:3","scriptId":20685,"text":"“找不到也许是好事，先慢慢处理被控制的钢舞姬，免得到时候被包围。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:4","scriptId":20685,"text":"“是啊，这里的区域地形复杂，我们也是人生地不熟，慢慢推进更加稳妥。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:5","scriptId":20685,"text":"“我倒也不是急，只是需要合理规划一下军粮和弹药的余量。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:6","scriptId":20685,"text":"“军粮还有很多吧，弹药也完全够用。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:7","scriptId":20685,"text":"“因为我们一路上也算是缴获了不少失控钢舞姬的口粮和弹药，所以才够用。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:8","scriptId":20685,"text":"“如果都是和战车兽或者旅行者交战的话，我想我们可就没那么富裕了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:9","scriptId":20685,"text":"在这片荒郊野岭，如果断了补给，那就不得不考虑撤退的问题。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:10","scriptId":20685,"text":"主要是因为带着齐奈达，迪塔格项圈会让她无法离开这片区域，一旦我们选择撤退，她将无路可退。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:11","scriptId":20685,"text":"“确实，拜这些钢舞姬所赐，这次行动目前还是非常顺利。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:12","scriptId":20685,"text":"“对了，这次遇到了不少钢舞姬呢，这些钢舞姬应该都不是死水的吧，都是陌生面孔呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:13","scriptId":20685,"text":"“是的，除了特勤局以外，也有从属于国家的钢舞姬，还有私人的钢舞姬。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:14","scriptId":20685,"text":"“大部分都可以从所携带的身份吊牌上确认。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:15","scriptId":20685,"text":"“嗯……这个我都有统计。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:16","scriptId":20685,"text":"佩妮掏出一本小册子，上面记录着这次行动中遇到的所有钢舞姬的名字和所属。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:17","scriptId":20685,"text":"“哦哦，怪不得我看你在那些钢舞姬身上摸来摸去，原来是为了找吊牌啊……我还以为你非常喜欢搜刮战利品呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:18","scriptId":20685,"text":"“……我可没那癖好。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-PROLOGUE:20685:19","scriptId":20685,"text":"“不聊了，今天的搜索份额还没完成呢，继续探索。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:1","scriptId":20686,"text":"在日落之前，受到了一队钢舞姬的攻击。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:2","scriptId":20686,"text":"“不太妙，我们可能被敌人锁定了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:3","scriptId":20686,"text":"“是的，敌人的攻击路线直奔我们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:4","scriptId":20686,"text":"“不过这个草地丘陵也容易暴露，不能说明问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:5","scriptId":20686,"text":"“再观察一下好了，今晚我们找个隐蔽点的地方扎营，轮流值班的时候都注意点。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:6","scriptId":20686,"text":"“如果我们真的被锁定的话，多半是因为齐奈达的项圈。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:7","scriptId":20686,"text":"我指了指一旁待命状态的齐奈达。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:8","scriptId":20686,"text":"“嗯。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:9","scriptId":20686,"text":"“那我要第一岗，到了半夜我容易困。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:10","scriptId":20686,"text":"“知道知道，如果姐姐抽签到了半夜值岗，那我就跟你换好了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:11","scriptId":20686,"text":"“谢啦～我的好妹妹。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"922001-EPILOGUE:20686:12","scriptId":20686,"text":"“真拿你没办法。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-08.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
